# ---------- Thunder Bluff, Orgrimmar, zeppelin ----------
N Teleport to Thunder Bluff (or fly there from Gadgetzan if you don't have it)
T 1276 | Mosarn
N Teleport to Orgrimmar (or fly there from Thunder Bluff)
T 1436 | Keldran, on the west side of the city. Hand it in now: at 45 it would be worth almost nothing.
TRAIN | Only if you are already 36: Orgrimmar mage trainers in the Valley of Spirits (Blizzard, Fireball, Mana Shield, Fire Ward, Dampen Magic). Mages learn nothing new at 35, so if you are still 35, skip this: the next segment trains in Undercity right after its first Teleport.
N Take the zeppelin to Grom'gol from the towers just outside Orgrimmar's front gate

# ---------- Grom'gol ----------
S Grom'gol Base Camp
T 1240 | Kin'weelay
A 1261 @ Stranglethorn Vale, 32.2, 27.6 | Click the Bubbling Cauldron beside Kin'weelay. Keep it for a later Dustwallow visit: the Jeweled Pendant drops from the Muckshell crabs there.
A 598 | Kin'weelay. Keep it for later: the Skullsplitter trolls are level 40+.
A 568 | Commander Aggro'gosh
A 570 | Far Seer Mok'thardin. It needs level 33, so this is your first chance to take it.
N Take any new quests offered in Grom'gol; the logger records them | Forever adds new quests here (one is a naga quest for the coast west of the camp). Take them only if they are at your level and you have log room.

