T 569 | Commander Aggro'gosh

# ---------- Booty Bay turn-ins ----------
FLY Booty Bay
T 1182 | Baron Revilgaz, top floor of the inn
T 213 | Kebok, in the inn downstairs: the 8 Tumbled Crystals
