A 1116 | Keep it for the Swamp of Sorrows
N Hand in any Zul'Kunda quests you picked up and take any new quests offered in Booty Bay if they fit your level and log; the logger records them
H Grom'gol Base Camp
N Optional Riverglades detour (Rog'mar) fits here | Main line does not need it. You arrive with only 6 quests in the log (1183, 1116, 1106, 1261, 598, 584). Bind at Rog'mar, use Teleport: Orgrimmar/Undercity for training and turn-ins, and the Brill trip for your mount at 40. Stay while its quests are no more than 2-3 levels above you and leave at about 41-43. If Rog'mar is on Kalimdor, Teleport: Thunder Bluff from here and walk in, then come back with Teleport: Undercity to start the next segment; if it is near Hillsbrad or Arathi, enter it from Tarren Mill or Hammerfall at the start of the next segment instead. Coming back at 41+? The first step of the next segment says how to handle its lower quests.
L 37 | If you skipped the detour and are not 37 yet: grind the Bloodscalp trolls around Zul'Kunda (TUGs' troll area, level 34-37), or the Lashtail Raptors and Mosh'Ogg ogres just east of Grom'gol. Pull two or three and Blizzard them.
